/Title (This analysis of Employee Performance data aims to delve deeper into the factors that influence individual evaluation scores \(emp-scores\). Because the HR department needs to present these regression models to upper management, the insights must be easily explainable. Specifically, HR is interested in how experience level, work hours, and degree types drive variations in employee scores. To improve model interpretation without affecting predictive performance can applies linear standardization. Standardization can be done in various way:)
